onality, and modern family living.<br> <br> Spread across 151 sqm, this well-maintained townhouse features a practical two-level layout with bright, open interiors designed to maximize natural light. The spacious living and dining area seamlessly connects to the modern kitchen, creating an ideal setting for everyday living and entertaining. The property is semi-furnished and upgraded, allowing tenants to move in with ease while still having the flexibility to personalize the space.<br> <br> All three bedrooms are generously sized and fitted with built-in wardrobes, while five well-appointed bathrooms provide added convenience for families and guests. A private balcony offers a peaceful outdoor space to relax, and quality finishes throughout the home enhance its contemporary appeal.<br> <br> Property Features:<br> <br> 3 Bedrooms<br> 5 Bathrooms<br> Built-up Area: 151 sqm<br> Semi-Furnished<br> Built-in Wardrobes<br> Spacious Living &amp; Dining Area<br> Modern Closed Kitchen<br> Private Balcony<br> Bright, Functional Layout<br> Ready to Move In<br> <br> Community Amenities:<br> <br> Children's Play Area<br> Landscaped Parks<br> Swimming Pools<br> Fitness Facilities<br> Cycling &amp; Jogging Tracks<br> Retail &amp; Dining Outlets<br> Supermarkets<br> Sports Courts<br> 24/7 Security<br> Located in the peaceful community of Centaury, DAMAC Hills 2, residents enjoy a tranquil lifestyle while remaining well connected to Dubai's major highways. Everyday conveniences, schools, supermarkets, and dining options are all within easy reach, making it an excellent choice for families seeking quality living at an attractive price.<br> <br> Annual Rent: AED 105000<br> <br> Contact Provident Real Estate today to arrange your private viewing and secure this exceptional family home.<br> <br> <br> Company: Provident Real Estate<br> RERA ORN: 1933","longitude":55.1885387,"negotiator_id":"717","negotiator_mapping":"umar.f@propertymanagement.ae","parking":["2"],"price":105000,"price_qual